lopment_evaluations\":3,\"experiment_id\":\"612e8e8ab023416d\",\"harness_attempts\":3,\"journal\":\"/gpfs/scratch/nimarano/hpc-forest-gpt61sol-max-archive-matrix-20261015-r1-coverage-gpt-6-luna-max/results-748259/2021-jacobi/logs/612e8e8ab023416d/node-harness.json\",\"llm_calls\":3,\"research_actions\":0,\"research_enabled\":true}",
